WEBVTT

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.980
Aw, man... I want some 
excitement in my life.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.700
Where'd that come from, Satsuki?

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.500
I mean, Christmas is coming up,

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.260
and then we have our class trip.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.740
I wanna make the most of my youth.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.120
I need to feel those butterflies!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.180
So basically... you want a boyfriend.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.200
Yeah, pretty much.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.320
Well, what's your type?

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.750
Let's see...

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.970
I'd prefer someone who's my age.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.010
Also, I'd like someone 
athletic and taller than me,

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.450
who looks great holding some 
carbonated drink in early summer,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.560
has short hair, is super friendly 
and popular with everyone,

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.400
and at the school sports tournament, 
all eyes will be on him.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.920
Okay, got it. Come back down to Earth now.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.780
Yeah, once I start, it's hard to stop.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.170
What's your type, Ruri?

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.840
<i>Girls sure love talking about this stuff.</i>

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.240
Me? I prefer older gentlemen.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.980
He'd greet me with, "Good day, milady," 
and he should be good at making tea.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.410
I will say that I prefer them taller.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:08.630
He doesn't usually wear reading glasses, 
but when you spot him with them,

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.030
he gets bashful and says, 
"My, how embarrassing—

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:13.280
Okay, we got it, Ru-chan.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.670
What's your type, Ichika?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.240
Huh? Um...

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.730
S-Someone normal?

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.910
Wow, that's vague.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:23.640
C'mon! We need the deets!

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:27.140
Someone... who's not tall...

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:30.000
Someone who's not that great 
at academics or sports,

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:37.400
<b>Tall</b>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:37.400
<b>Top of his class</b>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:37.400
<b>Very athletic</b>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:37.400
<b>Older</b>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:37.400
<b>Has light-colored hair</b>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:37.400
<b>Aggressively pushy</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.180
and someone who's my age or younger.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.540
Someone who doesn't have light-colored hair,

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.400
and someone who isn't too pushy.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.150
Oh, and someone who doesn't talk too much.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.180
Huh...

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.050
Wh-What, Rio?

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:44.330
Oh, nothing.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:48.990
It's just that I know someone who's the 
exact opposite of everything you just said.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.540
Oh, really? What a coincidence...

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.590
You know, the guy you just described

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.850
is Tamaru to a T.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:01.290
Wait, Ichika, do you like Tamaru-kun?

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:03.250
What? No. That was pure coincidence.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.140
Tamaru-kun's going to hear you.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.000
Oh, it's fine. It looks like he's asleep.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:08.640
Okay, enough.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:10.300
Let's stop talking about this.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.400
Anyway, what about you, Rio? 
What's your type?

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.420
Sumo wrestlers.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.150
<b>Sumo</b>

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.150
<b>New Year's
Tournament</b>

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.150
<b>Peace Reigns
Over the Land</b>

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.440
They're super strong, and I think 
they're probably open-minded.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.150
I guess...

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:24.660
That was the last thing 
I was expecting to hear.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.510
I even check out the Kyushu tournament.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:44.010
Koikimo

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:02.970
Koikimo

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.970
Episode 4

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.970
"On This Holy Night"

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.160
Looks good.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:15.210
Could you add this to the documents 
for tomorrow's meeting?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.070
What? Is there something on my face?

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.780
Huh? Oh, no! It's nothing!

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.280
So these go with the other documents.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:31.450
Don't you think the acting section 
chief seems a bit different lately?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.960
Hmm... He doesn't seem as prickly.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.280
Yeah, exactly!

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:40.730
It has to be something in his private life.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:43.220
It's probably his girlfriend.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:46.110
What? He has a girlfriend?

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:49.350
Is he even the type to pick just one girl?

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:53.850
So I guess the rumors are probably true...

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.280
"Let's just quietly admire 
Acting Section Chief Amakusa"

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.010
is the unspoken rule with 
all the ladies here.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.610
Right?

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.290
He's pretty much a celebrity in my mind.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:07.720
Just for viewing.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:11.210
You were definitely trying to 
get his attention a year ago.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.290
I'd just joined the company 
and I had no idea!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:18.380
Yeah, that's pretty much the image he has.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.000
But... I happened to hear something.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:22.700
Huh?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.670
Do you want to know?

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:33.850
Sigh, I just want to go home. Where did he go?

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.940
There he is. Acting Section Chief Amakusa—

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.300
Yes.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.260
<i>Oh, he's on the phone.</i>

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.310
Ichika-san, how's your cold?

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.930
<i>Ichika-san? That's a given name...</i>

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.660
<i>Wait, is that his girlfriend?!</i>

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.580
Oh, thank goodness.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.290
But the cold's still going 
around, so please take care.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:01.790
<i>So formal... She must be 
older. That's surprising.</i>

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.990
By the way, how did you 
do on the test at school?

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:10.060
<i>School? Test? That means 
she must be... a teacher!</i>

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.560
<b>Classics B</b>

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:14.560
Oh, dear, Ryo-kun. Were you listening to me?

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.300
That's great...

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:18.160
Huh?

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.060
Oh, I made that on my own, so...

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.620
<i>Wait, is he doing everything for her?!</i>

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:27.850
Here, I made this, if you'd like to...

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:31.100
I don't want it. I'm rather tired right now.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.150
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:37.540
Yes. Well, goodbye. Oh, Ichika-san...

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.670
I love you.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.940
Wait, seriously?!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:48.170
Our acting section chief actually 
said that with a smile?!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:46.630
<b>Squee</b>

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:53.080
He totally said that, looking like a 
middle school boy admiring his crush.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.460
I felt embarrassed for him.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.560
I can't even imagine him like that!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.740
I felt envious just watching.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.820
I want to feel that way and have 
someone feel that way about me.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.860
You're suddenly some chick at 
the bar that just keeps talking.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.140
Oh, hey. Our lunch break is almost over.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:12.820
Huh?

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.680
Let's try to get through 
the rest of the afternoon.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.950
I'm going to stop by the bathroom.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.700
Oh, me, too.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:24.380
A teacher... Older...?

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:41.970
Where are you taking these?

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.640
Th-Thanks.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.860
To the storage shed behind the gym.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:47.620
Mm.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:54.610
I'm sorry, Tamaru-kun.

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:57.600
You were probably heading home, 
but ended up helping me out.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:58.940
Nah, it's fine.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:04.370
What's this thing called? Like... a yodel?

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.400
You mean an easel?

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:07.310
Yodel...?
The Alps...?

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.310
Yeah, that.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.150
Are you in the art club?

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:14.960
Yup. I don't know what club 
you're in, though. Which one?

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.150
The literary club.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.840
I can see that.

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.060
They consider me a rare character.

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.980
So you don't show up much, huh?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.980
I'm pretty casual with my club, too.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.690
Ah... Are you drawing or 
painting anything right now?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:33.150
Right now, I'm doing an oil painting of a cat.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.850
I'm painting my grandpa's cat.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.820
Anna

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.820
Always appears to be glaring

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:37.820
Her name is Anna.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.500
She looks so mean, 
but that's what makes her cute.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.670
Okay, there we go. 
Tamaru-kun, you're a lifesaver.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.650
<b>Doesn't handle the cold well</b>

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:49.620
I have to return this 
key to the faculty room.

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:52.300
So, uh, hey...

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:53.150
Huh?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.230
Remember... the other night, 
when we ran into each other

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:58.050
at the convenience store?

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.180
Oh, yeah! Talk about a coincidence, huh?

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.810
Was it also a coincidence that 
you were with Amakusa's brother?

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.690
That, uh...

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:13.430
When Ryo-san called me, it was while I 
was walking home pretty late from club,

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:16.950
so he said he'd walk me home, 
and we agreed to meet up there.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.700
You guys seem close.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.630
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:24.000
<i>who talks to their friend's 
older brother on the phone,</i>

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.680
<i>then waits for him so he can walk them home?</i>

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.050
<i>Of course. No one does that! Not a soul!</i>

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:31.840
No, we really aren't close.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:37.090
So, hey... Remember when you said that 
you weren't dating Amakusa's brother?

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.970
Right! We're not going out!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.220
In that case...

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.070
How do you feel... about Amakusa's brother?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:51.440
Annoying, Troublesome, Nuisance, Gross

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:53.720
I don't think... I can sum 
it up in one word...

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:56.070
Oh, forget I said that.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:56.850
Huh?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.060
Sorry. Forget I said anything. 
I'm going home. Later.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:03.950
Tamaru-kun—

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.650
He left...

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:12.010
<i>How do I feel about him?</i>

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.170
<b>Stare</b>

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.550
<i>He's troublesome and gross...</i>

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:18.430
<i>But I don't dislike him completely...</i>

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:19.980
<i>I don't think.</i>

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.330
<i>Did I seriously just ask her that?</i>

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:27.250
<b>Mystery...</b>

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:27.250
<i>But what did that unpleasant face mean?</i>

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.660
<i>Now that I look at her, she and 
her brother really do look alike.</i>

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:35.450
Hey.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.480
Heya.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.600
Say, Tamaru...

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:39.400
Yeah?

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:42.090
Did you run into my brother 
right before our exams?

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.450
I saw him at the convenience store.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.200
Was Ichika with him?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.470
How did you know?

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:52.460
Well, my brother mentioned 
meeting someone named Tamaru.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.890
Oh, I see.

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:56.900
Well, since we're asking questions...

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.110
Are your brother and Arima close?

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.330
I'm not sure if I'd call them close...

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.350
More like my brother is crushing 
super hard on Ichika right now.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.490
Oh... I see.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.250
Yeah.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.360
Should you be telling people that?

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:19.780
Sure, why not? It doesn't seem like 
my brother's trying to hide it.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.490
He's aggressively pursuing 
her out in the open.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.670
<i>So that's what's going on.</i>

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.330
<i>I think most of my questions 
have been answered now.</i>

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.830
So how do you feel about all of this?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:35.870
Hmm... Well, I think it'd be fun 
if the two of them went out.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.630
<i>It'd be fun?</i>

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.660
Hey, do you like Ichika, too?

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.100
Huh? What?! Why would you think that?

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.170
Huh? Oh, it was just a guess.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.810
I've seen you two talking a lot lately.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.900
It's not like that...

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.550
That's good, then.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.510
If you really liked her, 
I was gonna give you a warning.

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:57.980
Huh? A warning?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:02.640
My brother's insane in more ways 
than one, so just be on the lookout.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:05.160
But if I was wrong, then never mind.

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:08.900
Well, I need to get back to club.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:09.820
See ya.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:16.170
<i>Pretty insane, huh?</i>

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:20.460
I hope you continue to get along 
with Ichika-san <i>as classmates</i>.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:25.210
<i>Well, it did seem like he was 
trying to keep me in check.</i>

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:27.270
<i>Do you like Ichika, too?</i>

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:35.020
<i>How do I actually feel about Arima?</i>

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:41.030
Koikimo

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:46.030
Koikimo

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.030
<b>T...
Today I made curry</b>

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:46.030
<b>I don't want any...</b>

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:56.700
Hey, Rio. I wanted to ask you something.

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:58.230
I'm not lending you any money.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:01.870
That's not it. Christmas is coming up soon.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:04.050
Yup. It sure is.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:11.640
<b>SUMO Store</b>

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:05.860
Right, so...

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:11.640
I... I was thinking about 
giving Ryo-san a present...

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:12.360
Huh?

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.800
But I have no idea what to get him,

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:17.010
so I was hoping you could 
give me some advice.

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:20.520
I see. When did you guys get that close?

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:22.950
We're not! Not at all! Stop that!

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:27.000
I wanted to thank him for coming 
to see me when I was sick,

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.780
and for making me that study guide.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.960
But Christmas is also close, so...

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.160
What are you smiling about?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:41.290
Oh, nothing. Also, you know there's 
only one thing my brother wants.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:43.550
You can be his Christmas present.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:44.380
Not happening.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.510
Okay.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.150
Then let's go look at 
some presents after this.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.630
We can discuss your budget while we look.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:52.960
Okay. Thanks.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.130
Thank you very much.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.510
Thanks, Rio. You really helped me out.

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:12.530
I wonder how I should give this to him.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.070
Well...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:19.880
Yeah?

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:21.670
What's up?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.840
I wanted to talk to you about 
something. Do you have a sec?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:29.340
Do you want to ask me what 
to get Ichika for Christmas?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.600
What? How'd you know?

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.170
Just a hunch.

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:36.750
<i>Onii-chan and Ichika are starting 
to think the same way.</i>

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:41.150
But wait. You've been sending 
Ichika a ton of presents already.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.930
Why do you suddenly need advice?

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:47.660
I've sent her a bunch of 
plushies and flowers until now,

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:50.740
but I figured I might be the only 
one who's enjoying giving her those.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:51.540
What?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.950
You're just realizing this now?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.810
No, I realized it,

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:59.830
but I was enjoying Ichika-san's cute 
reactions to those self-serving gifts,

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.470
so I just kept doing it.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:05.060
You're seriously the worst. 
What is wrong with you?

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:09.890
But I want to give Ichika-san something 
she'll actually like for Christmas.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.300
She does look cute when she's disgusted...

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:14.710
I'll bring you the Gaiden 
from that series tomorrow.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:17.210
Really? Thanks!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.730
But I wanted to see her 
genuinely happy even more.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.760
There.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.910
I just sent you a rundown of things that

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.760
Ichika is guaranteed to like.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:34.310
I'm sure any of them will make her happy.

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:35.200
Thanks.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:36.830
You owe me one.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.140
You're really cheeky sometimes.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.920
<i>So this is what Ichika-san wants.</i>

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.250
All that's left is...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.190
<i>All that's left is...</i>

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:53.090
<i>...Rio's present.</i>

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.760
<i>What should I get her?</i>

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.140
The final day... of the sumo tournament...

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.290
Amakusa!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.470
You forgot your pen.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.740
Hey, Matsushima. Thanks.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.510
Hey!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:19.370
What's going on, Arrietty?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.360
Could you not call me that?

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:24.890
Your name's Matsushima Arie, 
so Arrietty it is. It's cute.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:28.210
More importantly, why are you calling the 
acting section chief by his first name?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.800
Because we started at the same time.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.140
I didn't know that! Are you guys close?

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:33.710
We work in different departments,

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.870
so we basically just chat a bit 
when we see each other at meetings.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.180
You don't have a boyfriend right now, right?

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.860
What about the acting section chief?

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:42.560
Oh, please.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.720
I've never thought of him that way.

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:48.720
Besides, doesn't Amakusa have a girlfriend 
he's head over heels for right now?

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.810
Yeah, I think I heard that rumor.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:53.930
Something about an older girlfriend 
who works as a teacher?

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.650
All right, you're good.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:16:59.670
Thank you very much.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:00.570
Great job.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.460
I'm sorry to make you stay late with me.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.240
Acting Section Chief.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:10.180
Some of us were talking about 
going drinking after work.

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:12.050
Would you like to come?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.670
Huh? Um...

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.680
<i>Maybe it's too late today.</i>

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:20.090
You know he probably has plans for Christmas.

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:24.520
Well, I don't really have 
other plans, so... Okay, I—

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.990
Oh, sorry. My phone's ringing.

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:37.820
Sorry! S-Something came up! 
I'm out. Great job, guys.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.460
<i>Was that his girlfriend?</i>

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.610
<i>Must be a date.</i>

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.950
<i>Was that his older girlfriend 
who's a teacher?</i>

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:55.870
Ichika-san!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.540
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.410
No, I'm sorry for suddenly 
asking you to come here.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:04.650
No, no. I had just finished up work.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:09.270
So what brought this on? You said 
you wanted to give me something?

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.150
Um...

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:14.420
While you were waiting, 
did anyone mistake you

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:19.300
as an angel that came down to Earth this 
holy night and try to take you away?

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:21.160
Of course not!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:25.630
Actually, I was with Rio up until I called you.

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.600
With Rio?

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:29.020
But once I got a hold of you...

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:32.780
Well, I'm gonna head home to watch 
some special Christmas programming.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:33.880
Good luck.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:34.500
Huh?!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.970
She's just so...

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:39.940
Here.

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:43.470
This is for visiting me when I was sick,

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.690
the study guide you gave me, and...

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.980
A Ch... Ch...

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:52.450
A Christmas present...

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.490
M-May I open it?

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.980
G-Go ahead.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.270
You're being way too careful with that.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.380
I need to make sure I don't rip anything.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.370
A tie clip?

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:20.230
I-If you don't like the design, 
you can just throw it a—

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:20.880
May I!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.880
May I put it on?!

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:27.140
Don't just suddenly unbutton 
your coat like some flasher!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.270
You startled me.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.740
Thank you very much.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:43.740
I'll treasure it always.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.950
I'll put it on an altar when I get home.

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.620
Just put it on your tie.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:52.170
Ichika-san, I have a 
present for you, as well.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.240
Huh? You didn't have to.

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:56.340
This gift is special.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.540
Please open it.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.020
Fo...

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.470
Fo?

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:09.600
<i>Forward World</i>'s first-press limited 
edition Blu-ray?! Wait, why?!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:13.600
It even came with the shop-exclusive 
acrylic keychain... And it's Toho?!

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.600
<b>"Toho = Ichika's Favorite"</b>

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:16.450
I'd given up on it because I was broke!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:21.010
Oh my gosh! I'm can't... I'm so happy.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.240
Thank you so much!

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.090
Why are you laughing?

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:37.160
Oh, I'm sorry... It's just that you're 
even happier than I expected.

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:43.360
But how did you know what I'd want?

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.760
Actually, I asked Rio for advice.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.940
I told her I wanted to give you 
something that'd make you happy,

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.280
and she recommended that.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:55.270
Huh? I also asked Rio 
what I should get you...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.940
You did?

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:04.450
<i>You know, it's pretty hilarious 
that I basically ended up</i>

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:06.040
<i>suggesting both of their gifts.</i>

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.180
I'm home.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:12.300
Onii-chan? Isn't he home kinda early?

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.240
How'd the gift exchange...

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:20.380
Hello. I bought some cake.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.460
Huh? Why?

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:27.090
Rio, we wanted to have a Christmas 
party with you. Is that okay?

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.690
You guys are a trip.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:35.190
Wow, you really are a great cook, Ryo-san.

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:41.690
It's so good.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.400
Right? It's infuriating.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.190
What do you mean, it's infuriating?

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.960
Anyway, Rio, you're eating way 
too much chicken for one person.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.880
Well, I was bored.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:58.390
Uh, this is the family set for a party. 
You're gonna gain weight.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:00.960
I'll be fine. I'll lose 
the weight in my club.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:02.980
Really?

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.250
Next Time

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.250
"Pilgrimage"

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:38.540
Next time, "Pilgrimage."
